{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO (60 Min Playtime)</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into Mr Wonder\u2019s Studio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an abandoned creator\u2019s studio in this dark psychological horror experience. Survive lethal traps and twisted challenges. Uncover hidden secrets and the truth behind Mr Wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Atmosphere:</strong> Striking visuals and unnerving sound design keep you trapped in the fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962640/extras/275834534521114a3ac89fa9fabe900b.poster.avif?t=1756329540\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962640/extras/275834534521114a3ac89fa9fabe900b.webm?t=1756329540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962640/extras/275834534521114a3ac89fa9fabe900b.mp4?t=1756329540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Games:</strong> Face deadly traps, shifting rooms and challenges designed to break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962640/extras/478f3031260b1acffdc2474064ca89d7.poster.avif?t=1756329540\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962640/extras/478f3031260b1acffdc2474064ca89d7.webm?t=1756329540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_